    "body": "Yeah, Solus doesn't have `/usr/local/bin`.\r\n\r\nJust checked\r\n```\r\n$ systemd-path user-binaries\r\n/home/<username>/.local/bin\r\n```\r\n\r\nAnd you are right, I missed that dot. Thanks, I'll install it to the `.local/bin`. Thanks!\r\n\r\nWould be nice to have these flags in the quick start docs or make the installer more interactive.",
